      "en": {
        "hook": "Time your tap. Blast them away.",
        "pitch": [
          "Your top spins in a glowing battle dish while rival tops charge in. Tap on the impact and a shockwave sends them flying into the electric walls.",
          "Every hit costs you spin and every shockwave winds it back up. Keep it turning and become the king of the arena."
        ],
        "sections": [
          {
            "key": "impact",
            "title": "Tap on impact",
            "text": [
              "Tap just before a rival hits you. The closer to the impact, the more it pays, and a gold ring means a <b>perfect</b>.",
              "Hit after hit, your <b>combo</b> climbs. One wave can catch several tops, and a double or triple shock wins you extra spin."
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "rivals",
            "title": "Know your rivals",
            "text": [
              "Each colour moves its own way and shrugs off something different. At the end of the road waits a <b>boss</b> that only a perfect tap can hurt."
            ],
            "list": [
              [
                "Blue",
                "stops, charges and dashes at you."
              ],
              [
                "Yellow",
                "saws its way in and ignores the other tops."
              ],
              [
                "Red",
                "flies one straight line and blows up on whatever it touches."
              ],
              [
                "Black",
                "hands shell points back to the others."
              ],
              [
                "Purple",
                "splits in two when it breaks."
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "collect",
            "title": "Keep coming back",
            "list": [
              [
                "30 levels",
                "across five dishes, three stars on each."
              ],
              [
                "20 stickers",
                "won on the map or out of the gumball machine."
              ],
              [
                "A daily gift",
                "waiting for you every day."
              ]
            ]
          }
        ],
        "outro": "Press <b>Run game</b>, find the rhythm and tap on impact."
      }
    }
  },
